@startuml High-level component diagram
package "Simulator host" {
  [Runtime]
  [Image backend]
  [RPC platform]
  [Network]
  [World]
  [LTLf monitor]
  [Visualization]
  [Trace writer]
}
package "Private image copy (one per module)" {
  [Image API]
  [Zephyr kernel and coroutine runner]
  [Application]
  [Private libc boundary]
  [Image API] --> [Zephyr kernel and coroutine runner] : boot and absolute grants
  [Zephyr kernel and coroutine runner] --> [Application] : schedules
  [Application] --> [Private libc boundary]
  [Zephyr kernel and coroutine runner] --> [Private libc boundary]
}
[Runtime] <--> [Image backend] : prepare grants and collect output
[Image backend] <--> [Image API] : bind, run, destroy
[Runtime] --> [RPC platform] : dispatch copied frames after the epoch
[RPC platform] <--> [World] : reads and updates hardware
[RPC platform] <--> [Network] : sends and receives packets
[Runtime] --> [World] : advances global ticks
[Runtime] --> [LTLf monitor] : supplies observations
[Runtime] --> [Visualization] : supplies world and pacing state
[Runtime] --> [Trace writer] : records deterministic execution
@enduml
